abstract: >-
  ABDS is a draft OAuth-aligned profile for bounded, provider-enforced AI resource
  funding, entitlement resolution, economic consent, execution accounting,
  evidence, settlement, reconciliation, and revocation. Software and executable
  implementation materials may be governed by a different licence as described
  in LICENSE.md.
